11,49.0,121.9,10.0,0.0,False,I. Demographic Analysis
11,58.9,105.9,9.9,0.0,False,Per-pair sex was logged only at Look 1 (Table XIV). Male
11,49.0,93.9,10.2,0.0,False,"genuine pairs were auto-accepted at 81.07% (20,774 pairs)"
11,49.0,82.0,9.9,0.0,False,"and female pairs at 71.93% (3,531), a gap of 9.14 pp. Within"
11,49.0,70.0,10.2,0.0,False,"G1 the rates are 82.34% [81.81, 82.86] and 72.05% [70.54,"
11,48.7,58.1,10.2,0.0,False,"73.52] (pair-level Wilson intervals, which understate person-"
11,49.0,46.1,9.8,0.0,False,level uncertainty). No random-impostor false accept occurred in
11,312.0,486.6,9.8,0.0,False,"either group (0/982, 0/167). All three Look-1 hard false accepts"
11,311.6,474.6,10.2,0.0,False,"were male. Race, age group, and intersectional subgroups"
11,311.6,462.7,10.2,0.0,False,"were not analysed, although MORPH provides race labels;"
11,312.0,450.7,10.0,0.0,False,this analysis is required (Section IX).
11,312.0,419.8,10.0,0.0,False,J. Computational Cost
11,321.9,403.4,10.2,0.0,False,Table XV lists what was measured. The fusion stage is
11,312.0,391.4,10.2,0.0,False,negligible in size (947 parameters per seed). The dominant
11,312.0,379.5,9.8,0.0,False,"cost is SAM synthesis, which renders up to"
11,312.0,379.5,9.8,0.0,False,2+2
11,487.4,379.5,10.0,0.0,False,K
11,507.7,379.5,10.0,0.0,False,≤
11,519.6,379.5,10.0,0.0,False,16
11,530.1,379.5,10.0,0.0,False,faces
11,312.0,367.5,10.2,0.0,False,"per pair. End-to-end latency, its 95th percentile, throughput,"
11,312.0,355.6,9.8,0.0,False,"memory, and the cost of a cascade that invokes SAM only for"
11,312.0,343.6,10.2,0.0,False,non-decided pairs were not measured. Earlier drafts quoted
11,312.0,331.6,10.1,0.0,False,"per-stage latencies; we do not repeat them here, because the"
11,312.0,319.7,10.0,0.0,False,logs that produced them could not be located.
11,397.6,291.0,10.0,0.0,False,VIII. D
11,397.6,291.0,8.0,0.0,False,ISCUSSION
11,321.9,273.6,10.2,0.607,True,What the evidence supports.
11,321.9,273.6,10.2,0.645,True,For MORPH-like adult
11,312.0,261.7,10.2,0.509,True,"random impostors, the accept rule carries a finite-sample"
11,312.0,249.7,9.8,0.514,True,"certificate obtained from calibration data alone, and a held-out"
11,312.0,237.8,9.8,0.568,True,audit agrees. Branch-probability guards are what make a zero-
11,312.0,225.8,9.8,0.525,True,false-accept threshold usable for a fused score whose impostor
11,312.0,213.9,10.1,0.55,True,tail otherwise reaches 1. A reliability-gated synthetic branch
11,312.0,201.9,10.2,0.485,False,"can be included without destabilizing the accept threshold,"
11,312.0,190.0,10.0,0.51,True,provided it is masked during training.
11,321.9,177.6,10.2,0.563,True,What it does not support.
11,321.9,177.6,10.2,0.546,True,The current evidence does
11,312.0,165.7,10.2,0.0,False,not show that age-progression evidence improves cross-age
11,311.7,153.7,9.8,0.0,False,verification. On MORPH the full system accepts fewer genuine
11,312.0,141.8,9.8,0.0,False,pairs than ArcFace in every populated age-gap bin and creates
11,312.0,129.8,10.2,0.0,False,about three times the review workload. The strong hard-
11,312.0,117.8,10.2,0.0,False,impostor rejection is plausibly a consequence of training on
11,312.0,105.9,10.2,0.0,False,similarly mined negatives. The FG-NET gains come with a
11,312.0,93.9,9.8,0.0,False,"large, uncontrolled false-reject rate. These observations shift the"
11,312.0,82.0,10.0,0.0,False,paper’s contribution from a better verifier to a risk-controlled
11,312.0,70.0,9.8,0.0,False,"decision protocol, and they identify the experiments that would"
11,312.0,58.1,10.0,0.0,False,decide whether the synthetic branch has value: matched-FAR
11,312.0,46.1,10.2,0.0,False,"risk–coverage comparisons with per-pair scores, an ablation"
